<%# The one definition every number on the profile uses, said right next to
    the numbers (Tara, Nov 16 2026). %>
<% total = record.entries.size %>
<% extra = record.league_site_entries.size %>
One match = one line (court) played, with a result.
<% if team %>
  <%= pluralize(total, "match") %> for <%= team.name %>, from its scores on Court Report.
<% elsif extra.positive? %>
  <%= pluralize(total, "match") %>: <%= total - extra %> from scores on Court Report + <%= extra %> from league websites that have no score on Court Report.
<% else %>
  <%= pluralize(total, "match") %>, all from scores on Court Report.
<% end %>
